INSERT INTO instruments (instrument_id, authority_id, lg_id, kind, force, title, notes) VALUES ($q$ICC_CITY_PLAN_2025$q$, $q$ICC$q$, $q$IPSWICH$q$, 'PLANNING_SCHEME', 'STATUTORY_INSTRUMENT', $q$Ipswich City Plan 2025$q$, $q$The scheme is called 'Ipswich City Plan 2025', not 'Ipswich Plan 2025'. Citation and commencement: 'This planning scheme may be cited as the Ipswich City Plan 2025.' 'The commencement date for the planning scheme was 1 July 2025.' It replaced the Ipswich Planning Scheme 2006. Appendix 2 Table AP2.1: 'Amendment Package 1 – Adopted 22 June 2026 and took effect on and from 1 July 2026.' -> 'Ipswich City Plan 2025 version 2'. The ePlan revision API (api/l/vpr) lists revisionId 203 'Version 2' (planOperative 07/01/2026, revStatus 'Current') and revisionId 199 'Version 1' (operative 07/01/2025, 'Superseded'). The revision data lists no pending plan changes (planChanges = []). Version 2 is in force as at 8 Oct 2026. The ePlan is a JavaScript-only IsoPlan app; the text was taken from the public JSON API it renders from (api/l/r/{sectionId}/0/false/30-Jun-2026/false). Human-readable ePlan links use the pattern https://ipswich.isoplan.com.au/eplan/rules/0/{sectionId}/0/0/0/203.$q$);
