SELECT define_rule($q${"rule_id": "ICC.dh_ro2_1_front_setback_default_qdc", "instrument_version": "ICC_CITY_PLAN_2025@2026-07-01", "topic": "SETBACK.FRONTAGE", "title": "9.3.7.3 Table 9.3.7.3.1 (Benchmarks for Accepted Development Subject to Requirements), RO2.1 (Table 9.3.7.3.2 AO2.1 identical)", "role": "REQUIREMENT", "regime": "BUILDING", "enforceability": "DEEMED_TO_COMPLY", "provision_kind": "ACCEPTED_DEVELOPMENT_REQUIREMENT", "measurement": "SCHEME_SETBACK_FRONT", "operator": ">=", "value": {"op": "unencoded", "text": "if precinct==New Suburban: dwelling>=3m, garage door>=5.5m; elif zone==Rural: >=10m; else QDC MP1.1/MP1.2 (now QHC) value", "extracted_value": null, "extracted_operator": "conditional"}, "unit": "m", "on_noncompliance": "REFERRAL_TO_LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "effective_from": "2026-07-01", "verification": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM", "automatable": false, "scopes": [{"level": "LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "lg": "IPSWICH"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "ICC:LOW_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "ICC:LOW_MEDIUM_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "ICC:MEDIUM_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "ICC:HIGH_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "ICC:CHARACTER_RESIDENTIAL"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "ICC:TOWNSHIP"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "ICC:EMERGING_COMMUNITY"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "ICC:RURAL"}], "subjects": ["CLASS_10A", "CLASS_1"], "sources": [{"key": "dh_ro2_1_front_setback_default_qdc", "role": "PRIMARY"}], "interpretation_notes": "AUTO-IMPORTED (draft). Extracted structure: {\"parameter\": \"front boundary setback\", \"operator\": \"conditional\", \"value\": null, \"unit\": \"m\", \"conditions\": [\"Default: comply with QDC MP1.1, MP1.2 or MP1.3 (as relevant)\"], \"exceptions\": [\"New Suburban precinct: min 3m, and 5.5m to garage door\", \"Rural zone: min 10m\"], \"formula_text\": \"if precinct==New Suburban: dwelling>=3m, garage door>=5.5m; elif zone==Rural: >=10m; else QDC MP1.1/MP1.2 (now QHC) value\"}\nStructure scope 'Dwelling house (incl. secondary dwelling) and dual occupancy. Under SC1.1 a dwelling house includes 'any domestic outbuildings associated with the dwelling', so these outcomes are read as covering associated class 10a sheds/garages/carports (not expressly stated in the RO).' mapped by keyword to ['CLASS_10A', 'CLASS_1']\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: YES\nResearcher notes: Part 1, s1.5 Table 1.5.1 'QDC Alternative Provisions' lists 'Alternatives to QDC boundary clearance provisions' and 'Alternatives to QDC site cover provisions' -> 'Dwelling House and Dual Occupancy Code' (and 'Alternatives to QDC building height provisions' -> 'Building Height and Density Overlay'). The table does not pin-point individual ROs/AOs; the setback/site-cover outcomes of the code are treated as the alternative provisions. The default limb cross-refers to QDC MP1.1/MP1.2/MP1.3 by their pre-QHC names; Version 2 (effective 1 July 2026) does not mention the Queensland Housing Code. How 'QDC MP1.1, MP1.2' is read after the QHC replaced them on 1 Sept 2026 needs confirmation."}$q$::jsonb);
