SELECT define_rule($q${"rule_id": "ICC.dh_ro3_2_1_building_height_9_5", "instrument_version": "ICC_CITY_PLAN_2025@2026-07-01", "topic": "HEIGHT.BUILDING", "title": "9.3.7.3 Table 9.3.7.3.1 (Benchmarks for Accepted Development Subject to Requirements), RO3.2.1", "role": "REQUIREMENT", "regime": "PLANNING", "enforceability": "DEEMED_TO_COMPLY", "provision_kind": "ACCEPTED_DEVELOPMENT_REQUIREMENT", "measurement": "SCHEME_HEIGHT", "operator": "<=", "value": 9.5, "unit": "m", "on_noncompliance": "PLANNING_APPROVAL_REQUIRED", "effective_from": "2026-07-01", "verification": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM", "automatable": false, "scopes": [{"level": "LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "lg": "IPSWICH"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "ICC:LOW_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "ICC:LOW_MEDIUM_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "ICC:MEDIUM_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "ICC:HIGH_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "ICC:CHARACTER_RESIDENTIAL"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "ICC:TOWNSHIP"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "ICC:EMERGING_COMMUNITY"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "ICC:RURAL"}], "subjects": ["CLASS_10A", "CLASS_1"], "sources": [{"key": "dh_ro3_2_1_building_height_9_5", "role": "PRIMARY"}], "interpretation_notes": "AUTO-IMPORTED (draft). Extracted structure: {\"parameter\": \"maximum building height\", \"operator\": \"<=\", \"value\": 9.5, \"unit\": \"m\", \"conditions\": [\"measured to the peak of the roof\"], \"exceptions\": [\"Assessable development only: AO3.2.2 allows the OV6 Building Height and Density Overlay height where OV6 specifies more than 2 storeys (removed from the ADSR table in Version 2)\"], \"formula_text\": null}\nStructure scope 'Dwelling house / dual occupancy buildings (incl. associated domestic outbuildings by definition)' mapped by keyword to ['CLASS_10A', 'CLASS_1']\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: UNKNOWN\nResearcher notes: Table 1.5.1 names the Building Height and Density Overlay (not this code) as the alternative to QDC building height provisions. No separate height limit for outbuildings/class 10a. Version 1 RO3.2.2 (OV6) was deleted from the ADSR table in Version 2."}$q$::jsonb);
UPDATE rule_versions SET status = 'DRAFT' WHERE rule_version_id = $q$ICC.dh_ro3_2_1_building_height_9_5@2026-07-01$q$;
SELECT define_provision($q$ICC_CITY_PLAN_2025@2026-07-01$q$, $q$9.3.7.3 Table 9.3.7.3.2 (Benchmarks for Assessable Development), PO3.2 / AO3.2.1 / AO3.2.2$q$, 'ACCEPTABLE_OUTCOME', $q$PO3.2
Dwelling houses and Dual occupancies have a height that:
does not dominate the streetscape;
is responsive to the topography of the area;
is responsive to site constraints; and
does not unduly overshadow adjoining dwelling houses and their private open space.
AO3.2.1
Maximum building height is 9.5m to the peak of the roof;
OR
AO3.2.2
The building does not exceed the maximum building height of the Building Height and Density Overlay (OV6), if the Overlay specifies a height greater than 2 storeys.$q$, 'VERIFIED_VERBATIM', $q$ruleId 18692$q$, NULL, $q$Dwelling House and Dual Occupancy Code$q$, NULL, $q$https://ipswich.isoplan.com.au/eplan/rules/0/404/0/0/0/203 (JSON: https://ipswich.isoplan.com.au/eplan/api/l/r/404/0/false/30-Jun-2026/false)$q$, $q$SC1.2 building height.$q$, $q$dh_po3_2_building_height_assessable$q$);
