s not of a height or bulk to:\nvisually dominate the character building or character place; or\nobstruct views of the character building or character place where visible from a road or the public realm.\nAO5.1\nNo accepted outcome provided.", "extracted_value": 2, "extracted_operator": "conditional"}, "unit": "storeys", "on_noncompliance": "ASSESS_AGAINST_PERFORMANCE_OUTCOME", "effective_from": "2026-07-01", "verification": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM", "automatable": false, "scopes": [{"level": "LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "lg": "IPSWICH"}, {"level": "OVERLAY", "overlay": "ICC:OV:OV3_CHARACTER_PLACES_AND_AREAS_OVERLAY"}, {"level": "OVERLAY", "overlay": "ICC:OV:OV3_CHARACTER_PLACES_AND_AREAS_OVERLAY"}], "subjects": ["ANY"], "sources": [{"key": "char_po5_1_height_storeys", "role": "PRIMARY"}], "interpretation_notes": "AUTO-IMPORTED (draft). Extracted structure: {\"parameter\": \"building height (storeys)\", \"operator\": \"conditional\", \"value\": 2, \"unit\": \"storeys\", \"conditions\": [\"one to two storeys in a character area or residential setting\"], \"exceptions\": [\"additional storey where appropriate having regard to listed matters\"], \"formula_text\": null}\nStructure scope 'buildings in a character area' mapped by keyword to ['ANY'] (default)\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: NO\nResearcher notes: Performance outcome only; no AO."}$q$::jsonb);
